tion_id="ecom-a8zhh79wzb" deep="1"><figure><div class="ecom-container-image ecom-image-align"><div class="ecom-image-content-position ecom-image-default ecom-base-image-container-overlay" style=""><picture class="ecom-image-picture"><img class="" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/7991/2122/files/home_channel_logo_showroom.jpg?v=1774406077" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/7991/2122/files/home_channel_logo_showroom.jpg?v=1774406077 2000w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0676/7991/2122/files/home_channel_logo_showroom.jpg?v=1774406077&amp;width=600&amp;crop=center 600w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 600px, 2000px" alt="home_channel_logo_showroom" width="2000" height="1600"></picture></div></div></figure></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--last ecom-l3nz9x99bk"><div class="core__column--wrapper" id="ecom-l3nz9x99bk"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-animation ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-y7drsskv9wl" ec-delay="600"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-a8zhh79wzb" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">Our Humble Beginnings</h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-animation ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-vzrhrrzvvf" ec-delay="600"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-a8zhh79wzb" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed"><div><div>Channel International Enterprises took its first step in 2009 under its original name, Channel International Audio Supply, with its principal address at #380 Jacinto, Quezon Avenue, Quezon City.</div></div><div><br></div><div>After a year of operation, the company outgrew its initial 40-square-meter space and transferred to its current 250-square-meter facility located at 43 Don Alejandro Roces Avenue, Barangay Paligsahan, Quezon City—across Amoranto Sports Complex and in the same building as the Philippines’ largest recording studio, Asiatec Pinknoise now operated by WIld Grass Recording Studios.
</div><div><br></div><div>Through the shared vision of four dedicated individuals, grew through perseverance, hard work, and a unified purpose. From those early days of toiling and groundwork, Channel steadily expanded its capabilities and reach.
</div><div><br></div><div>Today, the company has grown significantly in both size and scope, becoming a complete source for audio and visual equipment needs. Channel International Enterprises also pioneered the Philippines’ first and only online store in its field, operating under its trade name channel.com.ph.</div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div></section> <section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-section__stretched ecom-n47ub6cahq" data-id="ecom-n47ub6cahq" style="z-index: inherit;"><div class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--first core__column--last ecom-ui2egeo3x8l"><div class="core__column--wrapper" id="ecom-ui2egeo3x8l"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-width-desktop elmspace ecom-gmznsdtldng"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__featured ecom-html" section_id="ecom-n47ub6cahq" deep="1"><div class="element__featured--wrapper"><div class="element__featured--box"><div class="ecom-image-align ecom-flex" href="#"><figure class="element__featured--box-img ecom-image-default"><img alt="ecom-no-replace-fv85od866eic-ft-ab-1" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0726/1221/7115/files/ecom-no-replace-fv85od866eic-ft-ab-1.png?v=1704787055"></figure></div><div class="element__featured--box-content ecom-w__full"><h3 class="element__featured--box-title" href="#">Conduit of Technology</h3><div class="element__featured--box-text"><div><div>Befittingly, the dictionary defines the word channel as a means of providing products or information available; a passage through which something flows; a route that enables movement and direction toward a specific destination.
</div><div><br></div><div>True to this definition, we are steadfast in living up to our name. Channel International Enterprises exists to be exactly what it denotes—a conduit for technology and audio visual industries, making products readily available, easily accessible, and purposefully directed to where they are needed most.</div></div></div><div class="ecom-button-default"></div></div></div><div class="element__featured--box"><div class="ecom-image-align ecom-flex" href="#"><figure class="element__featured--box-img ecom-image-default"><img alt="ecom-no-replace-nH6wxRLYwwic-ft-ab-2" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0726/1221/7115/files/ecom-no-replace-nH6wxRLYwwic-ft-ab-2.png?v=1704787190"></figure></div><div class="element__featured--box-content ecom-w__full"><h3 class="element__featured--box-title" href="#">Innovation &amp; Expertise</h3><div class="element__featured--box-text"><div><div>Channel supplies products and services to both online and offline customers, serving a diverse range of sectors that include houses of worships, universities, schools, hospitality, corporates , rental companies, broadcasting organizations, content creators and government agencies.
</div><div><br></div><div>Our services extend beyond product supply and include consultation , system design , installation and configuration, control automation , testing ,commissioning, training and documentation , system ongoing support and maintenance.</div></div></div><div class="ecom-button-default"></div></div></div><div class="element__featured--box"><div class="ecom-image-align ecom-flex" href="#"><figure class="element__featured--box-img ecom-image-default"><img alt="ecom-no-replace-ntG7aZFml0ic-ft-ab-3" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0726/1221/7115/files/ecom-no-replace-ntG7aZFml0ic-ft-ab-3.png?v=1704787163"></figure></div><div class="element__featured--box-content ecom-w__full"><h3 class="element__featured--box-title" href="#">Channel of Blessing</h3><div class="element__featured--box-text"><div>We are not only to providing outstanding products and services, but—above all—to a simple yet profound calling: to be a CHANNEL of Blessing to every person and every place we are connected with.
<div><br></div><div>This is a commitment we have set our hearts on, and it is the very reason we carry the name CHANNEL.</div></div></div><div class="ecom-button-default"></div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div></section> <section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-xk3wi11szw" data-id="ecom-xk3wi11szw" style="z-index: inherit;"><div class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--first ecom-9njlqa9zt48"><div class="core__column--wrapper" id="ecom-9njlqa9zt48"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-animation ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-t9sea3ipqi" ec-delay="600"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-xk3wi11szw" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">Our Services</h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-animation ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-s95di0beiy" ec-delay="600"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-xk3wi11szw" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed"><ul><li><b>Retail Supply and Delivery</b> - A comprehensive catalog of pro audio, video, broadcast, lighting, musical instruments, cctv, power tools, and more.</li></ul><div><div></div><div><ul><li><b>Consultation &amp; Needs analysis</b> – Understand your goals, room acoustics, lighting, users, and budget</li></ul></div><div><ul><li><b>System Design &amp; Engineering</b> – Choose the right displays, speakers, microphones, cameras, control systems, and cabling.</li></ul></div><div><ul><li><b>Installation &amp; Configuration </b>– Mounting, Wiring, Calibration, Network setup.</li></ul></div><div><ul><li><b>Control &amp; Automation</b> – Touch panels, tablets, or one-button controls.</li></ul></div><div><ul><li><b>Testing &amp; commissioning</b> – Make sure everything works flawlessly together.</li></ul></div><div><ul><li><b>Training &amp; Documentation</b> – So your team can use it confidently.</li></ul></div><div><ul><li><b>Ongoing support &amp; Maintenance</b> – Updates, troubleshooting, and upgrades.</li></ul></div><div>
